ArtemisLM: llama-server accepts -sys and applies it when the request has no system message.

The flag was limited to the CLI and a few other examples, and the server never read params.system_prompt. The console's Home prompt is passed as -sys. A client that already sent a system message, including the chat page, keeps its own.

